# Base URL of the Azure Functions backend (azure/ in this repo). Not a
# secret -- it's a public API endpoint -- but kept configurable so local dev
# can point at `func start`'s localhost:7071 instead of the deployed app.
# Baked into the build at compile time by Vite; copy to .env.local to
# override, or leave unset to use the deployed default in code.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://func-aw-azcom-copilot-iot-game.azurewebsites.net
